1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,328 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,456 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 12=

21
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,560
President Liu,

22
00:02:05,984 --> 00:02:08,840
this one should finally
satisfy you, right?

23
00:02:10,624 --> 00:02:12,439
Come with me to Nanyang.

24
00:02:13,312 --> 00:02:17,080
I guarantee I'll make you the celebrity.

25
00:02:38,304 --> 00:02:40,800
The truth that was covered up
eight years ago...

26
00:02:45,856 --> 00:02:49,504
(Entertainment Tycoon Jiang Xiaoren's
New Venture: Lidu Theater)

27
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,480
Will finally come to light.

28
00:02:55,712 --> 00:02:57,318
(Archives Room)

29
00:03:05,792 --> 00:03:09,879
I have nothing to do
with that Song Xiangxiang.

30
00:03:10,528 --> 00:03:11,680
You know?

31
00:03:12,032 --> 00:03:12,960
It's Song Mianxiang.

32
00:03:13,728 --> 00:03:15,168
Forget about whatever Xiang she is.

33
00:03:15,552 --> 00:03:16,639
Well,

34
00:03:17,824 --> 00:03:19,136
don't tell Chun'er.

35
00:03:27,552 --> 00:03:28,672
Do you hear me?

36
00:03:34,552 --> 00:03:36,448
(The Serial Murder Case in Fengcheng)

37
00:03:40,416 --> 00:03:41,479
Found it.

38
00:03:42,336 --> 00:03:44,704
The serial murder case
in Fengcheng eight years ago.

39
00:03:44,704 --> 00:03:48,520
The killer lured women,
assaulted, and brutally murdered them.

40
00:03:49,248 --> 00:03:53,280
And all nineteen deceased women
wore theatrical makeup.

41
00:03:54,784 --> 00:04:00,608
The investigation showed the killer
was from an opera troupe in Fengcheng,

42
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:04,032
named Zhao Shengge.

43
00:04:05,856 --> 00:04:07,199
(Zhao Shengge?)

44
00:04:07,872 --> 00:04:11,000
(I've heard that name somewhere.)

45
00:04:30,912 --> 00:04:31,680
Mother!

46
00:04:37,536 --> 00:04:38,304
Let go!

47
00:04:38,304 --> 00:04:40,864
- Mother!
- Without this rice, we'll both die.

48
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,840
This rice isn't even worth a bullet.

49
00:04:47,904 --> 00:04:48,448
Let's go.

50
00:04:48,448 --> 00:04:49,120
The next house.

51
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,168
(Zhang Lanying, Xu You'an's Mother)

52
00:04:56,544 --> 00:04:57,519
Mother.

53
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,319
Don't cry.

54
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,560
You're Shitou. You have to be tough.

55
00:05:02,112 --> 00:05:04,959
Even if you cry,
don't let them see you do it.

56
00:05:05,248 --> 00:05:06,120
Alright.

57
00:05:06,496 --> 00:05:08,240
I'll find a good job.

58
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,688
I'll earn money soon and buy you candy.

59
00:05:11,072 --> 00:05:13,184
We won't have to starve anymore.

60
00:05:45,696 --> 00:05:49,000
The killer Zhao Shengge was captured

61
00:05:50,336 --> 00:05:51,519
and executed?

62
00:05:55,296 --> 00:05:56,451
What's wrong?

63
00:06:24,224 --> 00:06:25,088
Mother.

64
00:06:27,456 --> 00:06:28,256
Mother,

65
00:06:28,992 --> 00:06:31,040
what happened exactly?

66
00:06:31,616 --> 00:06:35,072
I don't want candy anymore.
Please come back.

67
00:06:39,456 --> 00:06:40,224
What are you doing?

68
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,168
Stop!

69
00:06:43,168 --> 00:06:44,608
Brat, don't run!

70
00:07:03,648 --> 00:07:04,720
Here.

71
00:07:47,488 --> 00:07:48,576
Are you alright?

72
00:08:11,392 --> 00:08:14,240
The one in the photo is your...

73
00:08:14,432 --> 00:08:15,552
It's my mother.

74
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,079
I've always wanted a photo of her.

75
00:08:20,608 --> 00:08:24,720
So I could look at it often
and remember her face.

76
00:08:26,976 --> 00:08:32,639
So that she wouldn't remain a blur
even in my dreams.

77
00:08:34,912 --> 00:08:41,824
Now I finally have a photo of her,
but it's the one the coroner took.

78
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:46,000
I don't even dare to look at it.

79
00:08:49,536 --> 00:08:54,200
Back then, my mother said
she had found a good job,

80
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:59,960
and she would earn money
and buy me candy.

81
00:09:01,728 --> 00:09:07,039
I waited for her candy,
but instead I got news of her death.

82
00:09:08,864 --> 00:09:10,600
How could I be so stupid?

83
00:09:12,704 --> 00:09:19,039
I never even thought
that she was murdered by someone.

84
00:09:23,584 --> 00:09:26,480
Don't blame yourself
for what happened back then.

85
00:09:27,968 --> 00:09:29,440
It wasn't your fault.

86
00:09:31,328 --> 00:09:34,639
What's hateful
is that the killer is already dead.

87
00:09:35,904 --> 00:09:38,559
I can't tear him to pieces.

88
00:09:41,088 --> 00:09:45,960
President Jiang's death has brought up
this old case from eight years ago.

89
00:09:46,976 --> 00:09:48,720
This is no coincidence.

90
00:09:49,728 --> 00:09:53,720
Whether it's for Chun'er or for you,

91
00:09:55,072 --> 00:09:58,176
right now we have to
get to the bottom of all this.

92
00:10:02,976 --> 00:10:04,240
Get some rest.

93
00:10:05,024 --> 00:10:06,240
I'll be going now.

94
00:10:52,064 --> 00:10:55,840
Zhao Shengge was my master?

95
00:10:57,568 --> 00:11:01,279
My master had kept a beard for years
and no longer performed.

96
00:11:01,504 --> 00:11:03,559
Was it to hide the identity?

97
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:09,759
My master could never
be the serial killer.

98
00:11:10,496 --> 00:11:13,664
There must be more to this.

99
00:11:14,016 --> 00:11:16,704
(Rongqing Troupe)

100
00:11:55,936 --> 00:11:59,279
This is the photo from the illusion.

101
00:12:03,776 --> 00:12:10,120
(The one in the kingfisher phoenix crown
beside Master was Miss Jiang's mother.)

102
00:12:29,344 --> 00:12:31,616
(To know the truth
about President Jiang's death,)

103
00:12:31,744 --> 00:12:33,344
(come to Governor Mansion's back gate.)

104
00:13:10,912 --> 00:13:12,192
♪As if it were fate♪

105
00:13:12,192 --> 00:13:13,549
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

106
00:13:14,111 --> 00:13:17,348
♪We miss each other♪

107
00:13:18,592 --> 00:13:20,160
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

108
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:22,560
♪And a bizarre♪

109
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:25,362
♪Anonymous legend♪

110
00:13:25,892 --> 00:13:27,904
♪The plot twists and turns♪

111
00:13:28,052 --> 00:13:29,792
♪Play out over and over again♪

112
00:13:29,792 --> 00:13:32,856
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

113
00:13:33,056 --> 00:13:35,136
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

114
00:13:35,136 --> 00:13:36,128
♪Refuse to submit♪

115
00:13:36,128 --> 00:13:39,328
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

116
00:13:40,896 --> 00:13:43,840
♪There are always too many♪

117
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,792
♪Helpless situations♪

118
00:13:45,792 --> 00:13:48,416
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

119
00:13:49,547 --> 00:13:51,507
♪Even if I have questions♪

120
00:13:51,507 --> 00:13:53,507
♪I harbor desires♪

121
00:13:53,507 --> 00:13:56,384
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

122
00:13:56,735 --> 00:13:58,368
♪People come and go♪

123
00:13:58,368 --> 00:14:01,184
♪I'm still all alone♪

124
00:14:01,184 --> 00:14:03,912
♪Wandering around♪

125
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:07,013
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

126
00:14:07,013 --> 00:14:11,474
♪Go through the entanglement♪

127
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,568
♪If longing♪

128
00:14:13,568 --> 00:14:16,727
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

129
00:14:16,727 --> 00:14:19,482
♪How can I be at ease♪

130
00:14:19,584 --> 00:14:21,898
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

131
00:14:22,016 --> 00:14:23,872
♪And travelled around the world♪

132
00:14:23,968 --> 00:14:27,056
♪Scars all over me♪

133
00:14:27,328 --> 00:14:30,240
♪If longing never fades♪

134
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,689
♪Burns still hot♪

135
00:14:31,689 --> 00:14:34,768
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

136
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:36,897
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

137
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,144
♪In the next life♪

138
00:14:38,144 --> 00:14:42,624
♪Entangle with you again♪
